  "observations": [
    "Baseline automatic select measures 143 by 19 while independent native cell size is 152 by 21",
    "LayoutUnit uses 1/64 CSS pixels; original physical border/padding methods supply content-box offsets",
    "Element::currentCSSZoom flushes layout and cannot be called inside intrinsic sizing; audited engine zoom storage avoids that flush",
